sequenceDiagram
    participant SC as Simulation Controller
    participant VM as Vehicle Manager
    participant QM as Queue Manager
    participant SM as Statistics Manager
    participant GUI as GUI
    SC->>VM: generateVehicle()
    VM->>QM: addVehicle(vehicle)
    QM->>QM: enqueue(vehicle)
    QM->>SM: updateQueueMetrics()
    SM->>GUI: refreshStatistics()
